<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>Miscellaneous service means any other service which may be furnished and which augments or is incidental to any service performed by the club as authorized under the provisions of this chapter or any other service which is of assistance and is beneficial to its members and is feasible for the club to render.</p></caml:Content>